{%- set items = lines_text or o.products -%}
{%- if action == "succeeded" -%}
We've created a return for {{ items }} from order {{ o.order_id }}. Our courier will contact you to arrange pickup. Once the item is received and checked, the refund goes to your original payment method.{% if requested_remedy == "exchange" %} We don't exchange items directly, so once the return is picked up you're welcome to place a new order for the size or model you need.{% endif %}
{%- elif action == "failed" -%}
We couldn't set up the return for {{ items }} from order {{ o.order_id }} automatically. A colleague will arrange it and confirm with you.
{%- elif action == "held" and reason == "eligible" -%}
We can arrange a return for {{ items }} from order {{ o.order_id }}. Once the item is picked up and checked, the refund goes to your original payment method.{% if requested_remedy == "exchange" %} We don't exchange items directly, so after the return you're welcome to place a new order for the size or model you need.{% endif %}
{%- elif reason == "outside_window" -%}
Order {{ o.order_id }} was delivered on {{ o.delivered }}. Our return window is {{ policy.returns.window_days }} days from delivery, so this return falls outside it. I'm sorry we can't accept it.
{%- elif reason == "non_returnable" -%}
{{ items | capitalize }} from order {{ o.order_id }} can't be returned under our returns policy, because {{ category }} items are not returnable once delivered. I'm sorry for the inconvenience.
{%- elif reason == "not_delivered" -%}
Order {{ o.order_id }} hasn't been delivered yet, so a return can't be started. Once it arrives, you can request a return within {{ policy.returns.window_days }} days of delivery.
{%- elif reason == "already_returned" -%}
A return is already on record for order {{ o.order_id }}{% if pickup %}, and the pickup is scheduled for {{ pickup }}{% endif %}. There's no need to request another one.
{%- elif reason == "nothing_left_to_return" -%}
The items you mentioned from order {{ o.order_id }} have already been returned.
{%- endif -%}
